---
description: Protocol for the do-work task queue
globs: "do-work/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

- REQ states are pending, in-progress, and done.
- Only the main session moves REQs between queue states and owns `do-work/.lock`.
- `nestjs-scout` and the read-only domain advisors write only to `do-work/scout/`, `ratchet`
  appends only to `do-work/ratchet/`, only the domain advisors write to
  `do-work/proposed-conventions/`, and any specialist may append summaries under
  `do-work/summaries/`.
- Do not edit skill-owned sections such as `## Verification`, `## Plan Verification`, or
  agent-owned `## Plan Hash` and `## Ratchet` blocks unless you are the owning workflow.
- Read `.claude/conventions/do-work-protocol.md` for the full protocol.
